{"about_the_game":"<strong>INFEST YOUR FRIENDS!</strong> Neon Parasite is a game of chaotic critter combat where you'll be hovering, shooting, and dashing your way around the competition to reign as the most infested bug of all. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This 4-player local party game boasts crazy strategic battles across a multitude of different arenas.<br></li><li>Battle it out accross 4 different worlds all with their own unique flavor of stage hazards</li></ul><br><strong>NEON PARASITE IS SIMPLE TO PICK UP BUT DIFFICULT TO MASTER</strong><br>The combat is fast but strategic as you'll have to balance your energy between hovering and shooting, and balance your mobility between jumping and dashing.<br><br><strong>SQUASH PUNY BUGS</strong><br>Crush the mystical neon parasite to gain its effects, from bullet upgrades, to sneezes that launch you across the whole arena<br><br><strong>IT'S NOT OVER WHEN YOU'RE DEAD</strong><br>Play as your soul and Change the outcome by reflecting back bullets or dropping parasites on your rivals. Become a spectator by reacting with your soul or just causing mischief<br><br><strong>INFEST YOUR FRIENDS!</strong><br>There are 5 different types of neon parasite that will infest the players in different ways, giving (or removing!) different abilities for a short period of time. They will spawn naturally but can also be pooped out by the flying souls of dead players<br><br><strong>Master the Art Of Reflecting Enemy Projectiles</strong><br>Time a shot perfectly to reflect an enemy bullet back at them<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/29e3fc908077ac7bdb512441147e1388.poster.avif?t=1605306779\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/29e3fc908077ac7bdb512441147e1388.webm?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/29e3fc908077ac7bdb512441147e1388.mp4?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challenge the vicious Hydra in 8 different encounters by yourself or co-op with a buddy</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/25f3fe9aefce874d9b4f5ca62386d8fa.poster.avif?t=1605306779\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/25f3fe9aefce874d9b4f5ca62386d8fa.webm?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/25f3fe9aefce874d9b4f5ca62386d8fa.mp4?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Destroy the targets as quickly as possible in Target Smash mode</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/5e392c1368df1eb37a986e24af27504b.poster.avif?t=1605306779\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/5e392c1368df1eb37a986e24af27504b.webm?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246620/extras/5e392c1368df1eb37a986e24af27504b.mp4?t=1605306779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 to 4 PLAYER Local Multiplayer in Versus mode<br></li><li>Play online with friends using Steam Remote Play<br></li><li>Destroyed all your friendships? Bots will be your friends (or enemies) in Versus mode<br></li><li>Fight alone or with help in the fast paced Target Smash mode or strategic Hydra battles<br></li><li>Cause mischief when you're 